    <item>
      <title>FAQ</title>
      <link>https://sails.to/knowledge/faq/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://sails.to/knowledge/faq/</guid>
      <description>&lt;section class=&#34;page-hero&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;span class=&#34;section-label&#34;&gt;Support&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &lt;h1 class=&#34;section-title&#34;&gt;Frequently Asked Questions&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;    &lt;p class=&#34;section-desc&#34;&gt;Find answers to common questions about Sails CrossSecurities and our platform.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/section&gt;&#xA;&lt;section class=&#34;faq-nav-section&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;faq-container&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;nav class=&#34;faq-nav&#34;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;a href=&#34;#general&#34; class=&#34;faq-nav-link active&#34;&gt;General&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;            &lt;a href=&#34;#issuers&#34; class=&#34;faq-nav-link&#34;&gt;For Issuers&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;            &lt;a href=&#34;#investors&#34; class=&#34;faq-nav-link&#34;&gt;For Investors&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;            &lt;a href=&#34;#compliance&#34; class=&#34;faq-nav-link&#34;&gt;Compliance&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;            &lt;a href=&#34;#technical&#34; class=&#34;faq-nav-link&#34;&gt;Technical&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;        &lt;/nav&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/section&gt;&#xA;&lt;section class=&#34;faq-section&#34; id=&#34;general&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;faq-container&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;div class=&#34;faq-header&#34;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;span class=&#34;icon-wrapper&#34;&gt;&lt;svg&gt;&lt;use href=&#34;#icon-info&#34;&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;            &lt;h2&gt;General Questions&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;        &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;        &lt;div class=&#34;faq-list&#34;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;div class=&#34;faq-item featured&#34;&gt;&#xA;                &lt;button class=&#34;faq-question&#34;&gt;&#xA;                    &lt;span&gt;What is Sails.to?&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;                    &lt;span class=&#34;faq-toggle&#34;&gt;+&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;                &lt;/button&gt;&#xA;                &lt;div class=&#34;faq-answer&#34;&gt;&#xA;                    &lt;p&gt;Sails.to is a CrossSecurities infrastructure platform that bridges blockchain technology with traditional finance. We enable businesses to issue compliant &lt;span class=&#34;glossary-term&#34; data-term=&#34;crosssecurities&#34;&gt;CrossSecurities&lt;/span&gt; that can be held either on-chain on the &lt;span class=&#34;glossary-term&#34; data-term=&#34;solana&#34;&gt;Solana&lt;/span&gt; blockchain or &lt;span class=&#34;glossary-term&#34; data-term=&#34;crossconversion&#34;&gt;CrossConverted&lt;/span&gt; to bankable securities with an &lt;span class=&#34;glossary-term&#34; data-term=&#34;isin&#34;&gt;ISIN&lt;/span&gt; for custody at institutions like &lt;span class=&#34;glossary-term&#34; data-term=&#34;clearstream&#34;&gt;Clearstream&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;                &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;            &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;            &lt;div class=&#34;faq-item&#34;&gt;&#xA;                &lt;button class=&#34;faq-question&#34;&gt;&#xA;                    &lt;span&gt;How is this different from other tokenization platforms?&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;                    &lt;span class=&#34;faq-toggle&#34;&gt;+&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;                &lt;/button&gt;&#xA;                &lt;div class=&#34;faq-answer&#34;&gt;&#xA;                    &lt;p&gt;Most tokenization platforms force you to choose: either blockchain-native tokens (inaccessible to traditional investors) or traditional securities (missing blockchain benefits). Our &lt;span class=&#34;glossary-term&#34; data-term=&#34;crossconversion&#34;&gt;CrossConversion&lt;/span&gt; technology lets investors choose their preferred format — and switch between them. You get blockchain speed and programmability with traditional finance legitimacy and accessibility. That&#39;s what makes our &lt;span class=&#34;glossary-term&#34; data-term=&#34;crosssecurities&#34;&gt;CrossSecurities&lt;/span&gt; unique.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Getting Started with Sails.to</title>
      <link>https://sails.to/knowledge/guides/getting-started/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://sails.to/knowledge/guides/getting-started/</guid>
      <description>&lt;header class=&#34;guide-header&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;container&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;a href=&#34;https://sails.to/knowledge/&#34; class=&#34;back-link&#34;&gt;← Back to Knowledge Base&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;        &lt;span class=&#34;guide-badge&#34;&gt;Guide&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;        &lt;h1 class=&#34;guide-title&#34;&gt;Getting Started with Sails.to&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;        &lt;p class=&#34;guide-meta&#34;&gt;Complete onboarding guide for issuers, investors, and brokers&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/header&gt;&#xA;&lt;main class=&#34;guide-content&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;guide-container&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;nav class=&#34;guide-nav&#34;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;h4&gt;In This Guide&lt;/h4&gt;&#xA;            &lt;ul&gt;&#xA;                &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#overview&#34;&gt;Platform Overview&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;                &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#issuers&#34;&gt;For Issuers&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;                &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#investors&#34;&gt;For Investors&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;                &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#brokers&#34;&gt;For Brokers&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;                &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#verification&#34;&gt;Verification Process&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;                &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#support&#34;&gt;Getting Help&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;            &lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;        &lt;/nav&gt;&#xA;        &lt;section id=&#34;overview&#34; class=&#34;guide-section&#34;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;h2&gt;Platform Overview&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;            &lt;p&gt;Sails.to is a compliant platform for issuing, investing in, and distributing &lt;span class=&#34;glossary-term&#34; data-term=&#34;security-token&#34;&gt;security tokens&lt;/span&gt;. We combine blockchain efficiency with traditional finance compliance to offer the best of both worlds.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;            &lt;h3&gt;What We Offer&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;            &lt;ul&gt;&#xA;                &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Issuers:&lt;/strong&gt; Tokenize assets, raise capital globally, manage cap tables automatically&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;                &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Investors:&lt;/strong&gt; Access curated offerings, choose your custody model, receive automated distributions&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;                &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brokers:&lt;/strong&gt; Expand your product offering, earn competitive commissions, serve global clients&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;            &lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;            &lt;h3&gt;Key Features&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;            &lt;ul&gt;&#xA;                &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compliant by design:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;glossary-term&#34; data-term=&#34;reg-d&#34;&gt;Reg D 506(c)&lt;/span&gt; / &lt;span class=&#34;glossary-term&#34; data-term=&#34;reg-s&#34;&gt;Reg S&lt;/span&gt; framework with full &lt;span class=&#34;glossary-term&#34; data-term=&#34;kyc&#34;&gt;KYC&lt;/span&gt;/&lt;span class=&#34;glossary-term&#34; data-term=&#34;aml&#34;&gt;AML&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;                &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid custody:&lt;/strong&gt; Self-custody on &lt;span class=&#34;glossary-term&#34; data-term=&#34;solana&#34;&gt;Solana&lt;/span&gt; or institutional via &lt;span class=&#34;glossary-term&#34; data-term=&#34;clearstream&#34;&gt;Clearstream&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;                &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wyoming DAO LLC:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;glossary-term&#34; data-term=&#34;wyoming-dao-llc&#34;&gt;Legal entity recognition&lt;/span&gt; with &lt;span class=&#34;glossary-term&#34; data-term=&#34;series-llc&#34;&gt;Series LLC&lt;/span&gt; protection&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;                &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Secondary trading:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;glossary-term&#34; data-term=&#34;secondary-trading&#34;&gt;Compliant peer-to-peer transfers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;            &lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;        &lt;/section&gt;&#xA;        &lt;section id=&#34;issuers&#34; class=&#34;guide-section&#34;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;h2&gt;For Issuers&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;            &lt;p&gt;Launch a tokenized securities offering in weeks, not months. Here&#39;s how to get started:&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Roadmap</title>
      <link>https://sails.to/knowledge/roadmap/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://sails.to/knowledge/roadmap/</guid>
      <description>&lt;section class=&#34;roadmap-hero&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;span class=&#34;section-label&#34;&gt;Development&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &lt;h1 class=&#34;section-title&#34;&gt;Roadmap&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;    &lt;p class=&#34;section-desc&#34;&gt;Building the infrastructure for the next generation of capital markets. Track our progress from beta to global scale.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;roadmap-status&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;span class=&#34;pulse&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;        Currently in Beta&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/section&gt;&#xA;&lt;section class=&#34;roadmap-timeline&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;timeline-container&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;div class=&#34;timeline-phase&#34;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;div class=&#34;phase-header&#34;&gt;&#xA;                &lt;div class=&#34;phase-dot completed&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;                &lt;span class=&#34;phase-label&#34;&gt;Phase 1&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;                &lt;h2 class=&#34;phase-title&#34;&gt;Foundation&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;                &lt;p class=&#34;phase-date&#34;&gt;Q3 2025 – Q4 2025&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;                &lt;span class=&#34;phase-status completed&#34;&gt;✓ Complete&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;            &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;            &lt;div class=&#34;milestones-grid&#34;&gt;&#xA;                &lt;div class=&#34;milestone-card completed&#34;&gt;&#xA;                    &lt;span class=&#34;milestone-check&#34;&gt;✓&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;                    &lt;div class=&#34;milestone-icon&#34;&gt;&lt;svg&gt;&lt;use href=&#34;#icon-landmark&#34;&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;                    &lt;h3 class=&#34;milestone-title&#34;&gt;Wyoming DAO LLC Formation&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;                    &lt;p class=&#34;milestone-desc&#34;&gt;Legal entity established with full compliance framework for CrossSecurities.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;                &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;                &lt;div class=&#34;milestone-card completed&#34;&gt;&#xA;                    &lt;span class=&#34;milestone-check&#34;&gt;✓&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;                    &lt;div class=&#34;milestone-icon&#34;&gt;&lt;svg&gt;&lt;use href=&#34;#icon-settings&#34;&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;                    &lt;h3 class=&#34;milestone-title&#34;&gt;Core Platform Architecture&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;                    &lt;p class=&#34;milestone-desc&#34;&gt;Solana smart contracts designed and audited for CrossSecurities issuance.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;                &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;                &lt;div class=&#34;milestone-card completed&#34;&gt;&#xA;                    &lt;span class=&#34;milestone-check&#34;&gt;✓&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;                    &lt;div class=&#34;milestone-icon&#34;&gt;&lt;svg&gt;&lt;use href=&#34;#icon-convert&#34;&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;                    &lt;h3 class=&#34;milestone-title&#34;&gt;CrossConversion Design&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;                    &lt;p class=&#34;milestone-desc&#34;&gt;ISIN integration pathway and Clearstream custody protocol finalized.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;                &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;                &lt;div class=&#34;milestone-card completed&#34;&gt;&#xA;                    &lt;span class=&#34;milestone-check&#34;&gt;✓&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;                    &lt;div class=&#34;milestone-icon&#34;&gt;&lt;svg&gt;&lt;use href=&#34;#icon-clipboard&#34;&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;                    &lt;h3 class=&#34;milestone-title&#34;&gt;Regulatory Framework&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;                    &lt;p class=&#34;milestone-desc&#34;&gt;Reg S/Reg D compliance structure with automated investor verification.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Wyoming DAO LLC Explained</title>
      <link>https://sails.to/knowledge/guides/wyoming-dao-explained/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://sails.to/knowledge/guides/wyoming-dao-explained/</guid>
      <description>&lt;header class=&#34;guide-header&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;container&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;a href=&#34;https://sails.to/knowledge/&#34; class=&#34;back-link&#34;&gt;← Back to Knowledge Base&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;        &lt;span class=&#34;guide-badge&#34;&gt;Guide&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;        &lt;h1 class=&#34;guide-title&#34;&gt;Wyoming DAO LLC Explained&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;        &lt;p class=&#34;guide-meta&#34;&gt;Understanding the legal structure behind compliant tokenized securities&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/header&gt;&#xA;&lt;main class=&#34;guide-content&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;guide-container&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;nav class=&#34;guide-nav&#34;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;h4&gt;In This Guide&lt;/h4&gt;&#xA;            &lt;ul&gt;&#xA;                &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#what-is&#34;&gt;What Is a Wyoming DAO LLC?&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;                &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#why-wyoming&#34;&gt;Why Wyoming?&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;                &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#series-llc&#34;&gt;The Series LLC Advantage&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;                &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#how-it-works&#34;&gt;How It Works at Sails.to&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;                &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#investor-rights&#34;&gt;Investor Rights &amp; Protections&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;                &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#governance&#34;&gt;Governance &amp; Voting&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;                &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#vs-traditional&#34;&gt;DAO LLC vs. Traditional Structures&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;            &lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;        &lt;/nav&gt;&#xA;        &lt;section id=&#34;what-is&#34; class=&#34;guide-section&#34;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;h2&gt;What Is a Wyoming DAO LLC?&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;            &lt;p&gt;A &lt;span class=&#34;glossary-term&#34; data-term=&#34;wyoming-dao-llc&#34;&gt;Wyoming DAO LLC&lt;/span&gt; is a limited liability company that can be managed algorithmically—through &lt;span class=&#34;glossary-term&#34; data-term=&#34;smart-contract&#34;&gt;smart contracts&lt;/span&gt; instead of (or in addition to) human managers.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
